---
---
<section class="about">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about__head">
      <span class="about__eyebrow" data-reveal>
        <span class="about__plus" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        About us
      </span>

      <div class="about__content">
        <img class="about__logo" src="/assets/images/logo-v7.png" alt="" width="87" height="36" data-reveal />
        <h2 class="about__title" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:80ms">
          <span class="about__ink">Traditional funds move slow.</span>
          <span class="about__muted">We don&rsquo;t.</span>
        </h2>
        <span class="about__underline" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:220ms"></span>
        <p class="about__para" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:300ms">
          We break from outdated models that fear risk and avoid speed. Our model thrives
          on momentum, iteration, and founder-first thinking.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    background: var(--surface);
    color: var(--ink);
    padding-block: clamp(80px, 12vw, 170px);
  }
  .about__head { position: relative; }
  .about__eyebrow {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    font-family: var(--font-display-curved);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .about__plus {
    display: inline-grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 26px; height: 26px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
  }
  .about__content { margin-left: clamp(0px, 25%, 343px); }
  .about__logo { width: 87px; height: auto; margin-bottom: 26px; }
  .about__title {
    font-family: var(--font-display-curved);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 4.17vw, 3.75rem);
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.06em;
    max-width: 680px;
  }
  .about__ink { color: #090909; }
  .about__muted { color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6); }
  .about__underline {
    display: block;
    width: 230px;
    max-width: 40vw;
    height: 3px;
    background: var(--accent);
    margin-top: 30px;
  }
  .about__para {
    margin-top: 40px;
    max-width: 550px;
    text-indent: 72px;
    font-family: var(--font-display-curved);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .about__eyebrow { position: static; margin-bottom: 22px; }
    .about__content { margin-left: 0; margin-top: 0; }
    .about__para { text-indent: 0; }
  }
</style>
